      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ！　帰ったんじゃなかったのか！\r\n……何してるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040030,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "今は発声の本を読んでたっす！\r\n前の映像のヒント、あるんじゃないかと思って！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そうじゃなくてだな\r\nあまり無理しちゃダメだって、何回も言ってるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もしかして、ずっとこの調子なのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そっす！　でもなんでそんなこと聞くんすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あ、レッスンのあとにライブに行ったりもしてるっす！\r\nやっぱ生で見ると色んなことが見えるんすよね！",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あさひ……確かにあさひの探求心とか\r\n貪欲な姿勢は俺も頼もしいと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもな……それ以前にこういう無理が重なって\r\nあさひが体を壊しちゃったら、どうしようもないんだぞ",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……ごめんなさいっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかってくれたか、ありがとな、あさひ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前も言ったが、あさひはまだアイドルになったばかりなんだ\r\nだから、焦らずゆっくりと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それはいやっす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "頭から離れてくれないんっすよ！\r\nあの輝きとかドキドキが……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "絶対ああなりたいって、\r\nわたしもなんでかわかんないっすけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "とにかくあの気持ちを確かめないと\r\n納得いかないっす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが\r\n心配してくれるのは嬉しいっすけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "でも……それでも、じっとしてらんないっす！\r\nわたしは、もっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "わかった",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "それでも\r\n無理はダメだ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "少し動いてみてくれるか",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひの想い、しっかりと受け止めた\r\n明日、しっかり話し合おう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……どゆことっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無理をしすぎないラインは引かせてもらうけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひのやりたいことを\r\n最大限やれるスケジュールを組むんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "！　あはは、さすがっす、プロデューサーさん！\r\n明日からもレッスンレッスン、っすね～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、たまには休息も必要だ\r\n毎日こんな調子じゃ、体を壊してしまう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、これまでよりは色々できるようにする\r\n……何度も言うが、無理はするなよ。約束だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "はい、約束っす～！\r\nこれでもーっと色々研究できるっすね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040160,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ワクワクが止まんないっすね、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも無理はダメだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040170,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "え、なんでっすか？\r\nわたし、早く上手くなりたいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、その熱意は嬉しいぞ\r\nアイドルとして大切な考え方の１つだとも思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、さっきも話したように\r\nあさひが無理をして倒れたら、みんなが悲しむことになる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひが目指してるのは\r\nファンを悲しませるようなアイドルなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040180,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それは……違うっす！\r\nそんなの全然楽しくないっす！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だったら、やりすぎはダメだ　\r\nな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、あさひの代わりは誰にも務まらないんだ\r\nだから、もっと自分を大事にしてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040200,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "わたし、誓うっす！\r\nもう絶対無理しないって！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "少し動いてみてくれるか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040210,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "へ？\r\nこんな感じっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ、何か違和感を覚えないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040220,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "違和感……っすか？",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "少しだが、いつもよりキレが悪く見える",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040230,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……そっすね\r\nプロデューサーさんが言うなら、きっとそうっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。そのステップをずっと見てきた\r\n俺が言うんだから、間違いない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいか、あさひ。根を詰めて頑張りすぎると\r\nかえって明日に疲れが残るってこともあるんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "早く成長したいなら、しっかり休みもとるべきだ\r\n急がば回れ、なんて言ったりもするだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040240,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ふんふん、自分の体のことも気を遣わなきゃならないんすね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700104/1017001040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、万全なコンディションでこそ\r\nしっかりとしたパフォーマンスができるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017001040250,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "わかったっす！　プロデューサーさん！　ありがとっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
